   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AVP2021 DEL TL PFMO CAMOES (387410)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Contract related to: AVP2021 DEL TL PFMO CAMOES (387410) - The project will focus on 2 main components: 1) Strengthening the effectiveness, integrity, transparency, accountability, citizen-orientation and control of PFM in order to improve the implementation of fiscal and development policies; 2) Enhancing the capacity of check and balance state and NSA to play fully their role of adjudicating on policy choices and delivery mechanisms, as well as providing regular oversight and control of, and informing citizens about the delivery of State services.</narrative>
  </description>
